Package: cockpit-shares
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: François Rousselet <7969502+frousselet@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: cockpit-bridge
Recommends: cockpit-ws, samba, samba-common-bin
Suggests: wsdd, nfs-kernel-server
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/frousselet/cockpit-shares
Description: Cockpit page to manage file shares (SMB and NFS)
 Create and manage SMB shares with every smb.conf parameter, Samba users
 and connected clients, and NFS exports with every export option and the
 nfs.conf server settings, from the Cockpit web console.
 .
 Every change is validated by testparm or exportfs before it is written,
 and the previous versions of the files are kept so that they can be
 restored.
